{"id":"5c90bb6129c5e559","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process.md","title":"ZFC Prob Submartingale Process","display":"df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process — ZFC Prob Submartingale Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process — ZFC Prob Submartingale Process","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process — ZFC Prob Submartingale Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,M,Y\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,M,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\\)</span> (notions from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbSubmartingaleProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbSubmartingaleProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}submartingale\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbSubmartingaleProcess}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n+1)\n\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(M(n);\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n))\n\\land\\int_\\Omega|M(n)|\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\exists Y\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\n(Y,M(n+1),\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\mathbb P)\n\\land\n\\mathbb P\\left(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(n)(\\omega)&gt;Y(\\omega)\\}\\right)=0\n\\right]\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}submartingale\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbSubmartingaleProcess}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n+1)\n\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(M(n);\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n))\n\\land\\int_\\Omega|M(n)|\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\exists Y\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\n(Y,M(n+1),\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\mathbb P)\n\\land\n\\mathbb P\\left(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(n)(\\omega)&gt;Y(\\omega)\\}\\right)=0\n\\right]\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The filtration and adaptedness clauses now use the canonical sigma-algebra and real-valued measurable-function predicates; the conditional expectation retains its exact four-argument interface.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c75