aAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n+1)\n\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(M(n);\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n))\n\\land\\int_\\Omega|M(n)|\\,d\\mathbb P<\\infty\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\exists Y\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\n(Y,M(n+1),\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\mathbb P)\n\\land\n\\mathbb P\\left(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(n)(\\omega)>Y(\\omega)\\}\\right)=0\n\\right]\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2047,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process.md|58-df-zfc-prob-submartingale-process]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["d139c8e88761c759","36d7463d215be751","d4d304b0bbb11c1a","a740bdad87b97ac6","bbbec05fde1d3b01"]}